		},
		{
			"speaker": "公主",
			"text": "袜、袜子在笑！？",
			"emotion": "surprise"
		},
		{
			"speaker": "",
			"text": "（袜底的线头像活过来一样，在脚心上蹭来蹭去，钻进每一道趾缝里扭）",
			"actions": [
				{
					"who": "princess",
					"by": "chest",
					"zone": "sole",
					"fx": "lines",
					"repeat": 12,
					"interval": 0.14,
					"do": "tickle"
				},
				{
